ediscovered-time-capsule-of-lost-footage-180989635/</link><description>一名当地摄影师在重演过程中拍摄了 300 卷彩色胶片，其中显示了“步行的士兵与马匹的距离非常接近”以及“对健康和安全的相当轻松的态度”。该活动引发了一项持续至今的年度传统</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/hundreds-of-british-college-students-clashed-with-wooden-swords-in-a-1966-re-enactment-of-the-battle-of-hastings-watch-the-rediscovered-time-capsule-of-lost-footage-180989635/</guid></item><item><title>两位化学家因揭开分子“手性”之谜、帮助制药商开发更安全的药物而获得诺贝尔奖</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-chemists-win-nobel-prize-for-unraveling-a-mystery-of-molecular-handedness-helping-drugmakers-develop-safer-medications-180989643/</link><description>许多分子有两种镜像形式——就像左手和右手——但生物体通常只包含一种。然而，化学家无法弄清楚如何在实验室中只制造一种版本。 Henri Kagan 和 Kenso Soai 因解决难题而分享奖项</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 19:10:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-chemists-win-nobel-prize-for-unraveling-a-mystery-of-molecular-handedness-helping-drugmakers-develop-safer-medications-180989643/</guid></item><item><title>斯坦利·库布里克的个人档案即将拍卖，其中包括《闪灵》中的斧头和《2001：太空漫游》中的星童</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/stanley-kubricks-personal-archive-is-going-up-for-auction-including-the-ax-from-the-shining-and-the-star-child-from-2001-a-space-odyssey-180989632/</link><description>传奇导演的现场椅子、带注释的剧本和道具，让您一睹《全金属外壳》和《大开眼戒》等电影背后细致的电影制作过程</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 17:48:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/stanley-kubricks-personal-archive-is-going-up-for-auction-including-the-ax-from-the-shining-and-the-star-child-from-2001-a-space-odyssey-180989632/</guid></item><item><title>研究人员可能首次直接观测到系外行星的磁场，为更深入地观察遥远世界带来了希望</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/researchers-may-have-directly-glimpsed-an-exoplanets-magnetic-field-for-the-first-time-building-hope-of-peering-deeper-into-faraway-worlds-180989633/</link><descript